事の内容が複数にわたりそうだから、それぞれで1記事にしていいと思う。","ts":"1625045253.409200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=KhDS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f543592e-c247-49d6-b652-718143c8118b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u0026gt; 筆者の環境説明\nが、影響する設定であるならしっかり、ないなら軽くでいいかなくらい?\nあとは思うがままに一度書いて、どんどん直してもいいだろうし","ts":"1625045212.408600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h6S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2879CE27-8C19-457D-89E6-25E3924BDE35","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ファイル分割の構成のことかな","ts":"1625045094.407500","edited":{"user":"UDDCM376D","ts":"1625045104.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Lu3u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67df7ea9-8734-4421-a3a6-577b0a0bf03b","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あとは、 `foldmethod`での折り畳みの説明を入れておくと良さげかもです","ts":"1625045025.407200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T/W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"865799fa-de52-4379-84ad-3fc60c4ff7f7","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"\u0026gt; vimrcのフォルダ構成\nこれってどういうことですか?","ts":"1625044960.406600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j1B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1C519BA3-3687-429E-B19E-816F23576B9B","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"Zennに「オレvimrcの設定ちょっとデキル」みたいな記事を書こうと思っています。\n対象はoptionとプラグインはなんとなく入れてみた〜オレvim scriptちょっとカケル未満を想定してます。\n\n実体験を元に以下の構成で書こうと思ってるんですが、書いた方がいいor書かない方がいいことってありますか？\n\n・筆者の環境説明\n・とりあえず便利になるようにpluginをいれる\n・vimrcのフォルダ構成\n・書く上で便利な設定（vimrcソース読み込みなど）\n・\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt;、function、autocmd、command\nPrefix （ここらへんを1番押したい）\n・コミュニティに入る（エンジニアの楽園）\n・vimrc読書会にいく\n・人のdotfileを見る（数例紹介）\n","ts":"1625044892.405700","edited":{"user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","ts":"1625044951.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B3+"}]}]
